 turnovers in 45-27 win over Patriots","d":"2026-11-09T02:27:35Z","u":"http://www.espn.com/nfl/recap?gameId=401873049","desc":"— If Jordan Love has played a better game than he did on Sunday, he can't remember it."},{"t":"Fantasy buzz: Week 9 scoring leaders through Sunday's 4 p.m. ET games","d":"2026-11-09T01:03:13Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/id/40699880/fantasy-football-injuries-position-battles-nfl-news-analysis","desc":"Kenneth Walker III led Sunday afternoon fantasy scorers, and the Packers piled on the points in New England."},{"t":"Green Bay Packers vs. New England Patriots: Game Highlights","d":"2026-11-09T00:59:23Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50427757/game-highlights","desc":"Green Bay Packers vs. New England Patriots: Game Highlights"},{"t":"Houston Texans vs. Los Angeles Chargers: Game Highlights","d":"2026-11-09T00:59:16Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/video/clip/_/id/50427746/game-highlights","desc":"Houston Texans vs. Los Angeles Chargers: Game Highlights"},{"t":"Week 9 NFL highlights: Best plays, moments, touchdowns, more","d":"2026-11-09T00:55:43Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50409762/week-9-sunday-highlights-best-plays-touchdowns-2026","desc":"Check here for Sunday's top moments, TDs and analysis."},{"t":"Multidrop game in Colts' loss irks WR Josh Downs as trade deadline looms","d":"2026-11-09T01:37:21Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50427666/multi-drop-game-irks-colts-wr-downs-trade-deadline-nears","desc":"Veteran receiver Josh Downs, who recently requested a trade away from the Indianapolis Colts, authored one of the most forgettable performances of his career Sunday, a multidrop effort at Lucas Oil Stadium in his team's 27-23 loss to the Dallas Cowboys."},{"t":"Judging overreactions to NFL Week 9 -- and what they mean for the trade deadline","d":"2026-11-09T02:13:08Z","u":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50422026/week-9-overreactions-2026-graziano-trade-deadline-bengals-cowboys","des